    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know i should get help but it feels like a lie. like i'm just pretending i can get better so they don't feel bad. but the truth is i'm just a drain on their energy and their happiness. if i wasn't even here, they could finally breathe again. they could actually have a life without being stuck babysitting a ghost.",
